#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DATE"
msgstr "DATE"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux
#, no-wrap
msgid "August 2024"
msgstr "август 2024 г."

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "GNU coreutils 9.5"
msgstr "GNU coreutils 9.5"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Commands"
msgstr "Команды пользователя"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "НАИМЕНОВАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "date - print or set the system date and time"
msgstr "date — вывести или установить системные дату и время"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "ОБЗОР"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<date> [I<\\,OPTION\\/>]... [I<\\,+FORMAT\\/>]"
msgstr "B<date> [I<\\,ПАРАМЕТР\\/>]... [I<\\,+ФОРМАТ\\/>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<date> [I<\\,-u|--utc|--universal\\/>] [I<\\,MMDDhhmm\\/>[[I<\\,CC\\/>]I<\\,"
"YY\\/>][I<\\,.ss\\/>]]"
msgstr ""
"B<date> [I<\\,-u|--utc|--universal\\/>] [I<\\,ММДДччмм\\/>[[I<\\,ВВ\\/>]I<\\,"
"ГГ\\/>][I<\\,.сс\\/>]]"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "ОПИСАНИЕ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Display date and time in the given FORMAT.  With B<-s>, or with "
"[MMDDhhmm[[CC]YY][.ss]], set the date and time."
msgstr ""
"Отобразить дату и время в заданном ФОРМАТе. При использовании B<-s> или "
"[ММДДччмм[[ВВ]ГГ][.сс]] установить дату и время."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr ""
"Обязательные аргументы для длинных опций обязательны и для коротких опций."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-d>, B<--date>=I<\\,STRING\\/>"
msgstr "B<-d>, B<--date>=I<\\,СТРОКА\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display time described by STRING, not 'now'"
msgstr "отобразить время, описанное в СТРОКЕ, вместо «now» (текущее время)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--debug>"
msgstr "B<--debug>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "annotate the parsed date, and warn about questionable usage to stderr"
msgstr ""
"пояснять порядок разбора даты и выводить предупреждения о неточностях в "
"стандартный поток ошибок"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>, B<--file>=I<\\,DATEFILE\\/>"
msgstr "B<-f>, B<--file>=I<\\,ФАЙЛДАТ\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<--date>; once for each line of DATEFILE"
msgstr "то же, что и B<--date>; повторять для каждой строки файла ФАЙЛДАТ"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-I[FMT]>, B<--iso-8601>[=I<\\,FMT\\/>]"
msgstr "B<-I[ФОРМ]>, B<--iso-8601>[=I<\\,ФОРМ\\/>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output date/time in ISO 8601 format.  FMT='date' for date only (the "
"default), \\&'hours', 'minutes', 'seconds', or 'ns' for date and time to the "
"indicated precision.  Example: 2006-08-14T02:34:56-06:00"
msgstr ""
"вывести дату/время в формате ISO 8601. Указание «date» в качестве ФОРМ (по "
"умолчанию) позволяет вывести только дату, указание «hours» (часы), "
"«minutes» (минуты), «seconds» (секунды) или «ns» (наносекунды) позволяет "
"вывести дату и время с соответствующей точностью. Пример: "
"2006-08-14T02:34:56-06:00"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--resolution>"
msgstr "B<--resolution>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output the available resolution of timestamps Example: 0.000000001"
msgstr "вывести доступное разрешение временных меток. Пример: 0.000000001"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-R>, B<--rfc-email>"
msgstr "B<-R>, B<--rfc-email>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output date and time in RFC 5322 format.  Example: Mon, 14 Aug 2006 02:34:56 "
"B<-0600>"
msgstr ""
"вывести дату и время в формате RFC 5322. Пример: Mon, 14 Aug 2006 02:34:56 "
"B<-0600>"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--rfc-3339>=I<\\,FMT\\/>"
msgstr "B<--rfc-3339>=I<\\,ФОРМ\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output date/time in RFC 3339 format.  FMT='date', 'seconds', or 'ns' for "
"date and time to the indicated precision.  Example: 2006-08-14 02:34:56-06:00"
msgstr ""
"вывести дату/время в формате RFC 3339. Указание «date» (дата), "
"«seconds» (секунды) или «ns» (наносекунды) в качестве ФОРМ позволяет вывести "
"дату и время с соответствующей точностью. Пример: 2006-08-14 02:34:56-06:00"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-r>, B<--reference>=I<\\,FILE\\/>"
msgstr "B<-r>, B<--reference>=I<\\,ФАЙЛ\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display the last modification time of FILE"
msgstr "отобразить время последнего изменения ФАЙЛа"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-s>, B<--set>=I<\\,STRING\\/>"
msgstr "B<-s>, B<--set>=I<\\,СТРОКА\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "set time described by STRING"
msgstr "установить время, описанное в СТРОКЕ"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-u>, B<--utc>, B<--universal>"
msgstr "B<-u>, B<--utc>, B<--universal>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "print or set Coordinated Universal Time (UTC)"
msgstr "вывести или установить Всемирное координированное время (UTC)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "отобразить эту справочную информацию и завершить работу"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "вывести информацию о версии и завершить работу"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"All options that specify the date to display are mutually exclusive.  I.e.: "
"B<--date>, B<--file>, B<--reference>, B<--resolution>."
msgstr ""
"Все параметры, задающие отображаемую дату, являются взаимоисключающими: B<--"
"date>, B<--file>, B<--reference>, B<--resolution>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "FORMAT controls the output.  Interpreted sequences are:"
msgstr ""
"ФОРМАТ определяет выводимые данные. Распознаются следующие "
"последовательности:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%%"
msgstr "%%"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "a literal %"
msgstr "символ %"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%a"
msgstr "%a"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's abbreviated weekday name (e.g., Sun)"
msgstr ""
"сокращённое название дня недели с учётом текущего региона (например, Вс)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%A"
msgstr "%A"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's full weekday name (e.g., Sunday)"
msgstr ""
"полное название дня недели с учётом текущего региона (например, Воскресенье)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%b"
msgstr "%b"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's abbreviated month name (e.g., Jan)"
msgstr "сокращённое название месяца с учётом текущего региона (например, янв)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%B"
msgstr "%B"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's full month name (e.g., January)"
msgstr "полное название месяца с учётом текущего региона (например, январь)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%c"
msgstr "%c"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's date and time (e.g., Thu Mar 3 23:05:25 2005)"
msgstr ""
"дата и время с учётом текущего региона (например, Чт 03 мар 2005 23:05:25)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%C"
msgstr "%C"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "century; like %Y, except omit last two digits (e.g., 20)"
msgstr "век; то же, что и %Y, но без последних двух цифр (например, 20)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%d"
msgstr "%d"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of month (e.g., 01)"
msgstr "число (например, 01)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%D"
msgstr "%D"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "date; same as %m/%d/%y"
msgstr "дата; то же, что и %m/%d/%y"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%e"
msgstr "%e"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of month, space padded; same as %_d"
msgstr "число с ведущим пробелом; то же, что и %_d"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%F"
msgstr "%F"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "full date; like %+4Y-%m-%d"
msgstr "полная дата; то же, что и %+4Y-%m-%d"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%g"
msgstr "%g"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "last two digits of year of ISO week number (see %G)"
msgstr "две последние цифры года при нумерации недель согласно ISO (см. %G)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%G"
msgstr "%G"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "year of ISO week number (see %V); normally useful only with %V"
msgstr ""
"год при нумерации недель согласно ISO (см. %V); обычно применим только с %V"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%h"
msgstr "%h"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "same as %b"
msgstr "то же, что и %b"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%H"
msgstr "%H"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour (00..23)"
msgstr "часы (00..23)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%I"
msgstr "%I"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour (01..12)"
msgstr "часы (01..12)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%j"
msgstr "%j"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of year (001..366)"
msgstr "номер дня в году (001..366)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%k"
msgstr "%k"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour, space padded ( 0..23); same as %_H"
msgstr "часы с ведущим пробелом ( 0..23); то же, что и %_H"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%l"
msgstr "%l"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour, space padded ( 1..12); same as %_I"
msgstr "часы с ведущим пробелом ( 1..12); то же, что и %_I"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%m"
msgstr "%m"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "month (01..12)"
msgstr "месяц (01..12)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%M"
msgstr "%M"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "minute (00..59)"
msgstr "минуты (00..59)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%n"
msgstr "%n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "a newline"
msgstr "перевод на новую строку"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%N"
msgstr "%N"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "nanoseconds (000000000..999999999)"
msgstr "наносекунды (000000000..999999999)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%p"
msgstr "%p"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's equivalent of either AM or PM; blank if not known"
msgstr ""
"аналог AM или PM с учётом текущего региона; пустая строка, если аналог "
"неизвестен"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%P"
msgstr "%P"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like %p, but lower case"
msgstr "то же, что и %p, но в нижнем регистре"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%q"
msgstr "%q"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "quarter of year (1..4)"
msgstr "квартал (1..4)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%r"
msgstr "%r"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's 12-hour clock time (e.g., 11:11:04 PM)"
msgstr ""
"время в 12-часовом формате с учётом текущего региона (например, 11:11:04)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%R"
msgstr "%R"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "24-hour hour and minute; same as %H:%M"
msgstr "часы и минуты в 24-часовом формате; то же, что и %H:%M"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%s"
msgstr "%s"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "seconds since the Epoch (1970-01-01 00:00 UTC)"
msgstr "количество секунд с момента Epoch (01.01.1970 00:00 UTC)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%S"
msgstr "%S"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "second (00..60)"
msgstr "секунды (00..60)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%t"
msgstr "%t"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "a tab"
msgstr "символ табуляции"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%T"
msgstr "%T"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "time; same as %H:%M:%S"
msgstr "время; то же, что и %H:%M:%S"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%u"
msgstr "%u"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of week (1..7); 1 is Monday"
msgstr "день недели (1..7); 1 — это понедельник"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%U"
msgstr "%U"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "week number of year, with Sunday as first day of week (00..53)"
msgstr "номер недели в году, первым днём недели считается воскресенье (00..53)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%V"
msgstr "%V"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "ISO week number, with Monday as first day of week (01..53)"
msgstr ""
"номер недели согласно ISO, первым днём недели считается понедельник (01..53)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%w"
msgstr "%w"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of week (0..6); 0 is Sunday"
msgstr "день недели (0..6); 0 — это воскресенье"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%W"
msgstr "%W"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "week number of year, with Monday as first day of week (00..53)"
msgstr "номер недели в году, первым днём недели считается понедельник (00..53)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%x"
msgstr "%x"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's date representation (e.g., 12/31/99)"
msgstr "представление даты с учётом текущего региона (например, 31.12.1999)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%X"
msgstr "%X"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's time representation (e.g., 23:13:48)"
msgstr "представление времени с учётом текущего региона (например, 23:13:48)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%y"
msgstr "%y"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "last two digits of year (00..99)"
msgstr "две последние цифры года (00..99)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%Y"
msgstr "%Y"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "year"
msgstr "год"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%z"
msgstr "%z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "+hhmm numeric time zone (e.g., B<-0400>)"
msgstr ""
"числовое представление часового пояса в формате +ччмм (например, B<-0400>)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%:z"
msgstr "%:z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "+hh:mm numeric time zone (e.g., B<-04>:00)"
msgstr ""
"числовое представление часового пояса в формате +чч:мм (например, B<-04>:00)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%::z"
msgstr "%::z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "+hh:mm:ss numeric time zone (e.g., B<-04>:00:00)"
msgstr ""
"числовое представление часового пояса в формате +чч:мм:сс (например, "
"B<-04>:00:00)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%:::z"
msgstr "%:::z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "numeric time zone with : to necessary precision (e.g., B<-04>, +05:30)"
msgstr ""
"числовое представление часового пояса с использованием «:» для достижения "
"необходимой точности (например, B<-04>, +05:30)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%Z"
msgstr "%Z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "alphabetic time zone abbreviation (e.g., EDT)"
msgstr "буквенное сокращение часового пояса (например, EDT)"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"By default, date pads numeric fields with zeroes.  The following optional "
"flags may follow '%':"
msgstr ""
"По умолчанию date дополняет числовые поля нулями. За символом «%» могут быть "
"указаны следующие необязательные флаги:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "-"
msgstr "-"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "(hyphen) do not pad the field"
msgstr "(дефис) не дополнять поле"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "_"
msgstr "_"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "(underscore) pad with spaces"
msgstr "(подчёркивание) дополнять пробелами"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "(zero) pad with zeros"
msgstr "(ноль) дополнять нулями"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "+"
msgstr "+"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "pad with zeros, and put '+' before future years with E<gt>4 digits"
msgstr "дополнять нулями и выводить «+» перед будущими годами с E<gt>4 цифрами"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "^"
msgstr "^"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use upper case if possible"
msgstr "по возможности использовать верхний регистр"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "#"
msgstr "#"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use opposite case if possible"
msgstr "по возможности использовать другой регистр"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"After any flags comes an optional field width, as a decimal number; then an "
"optional modifier, which is either E to use the locale's alternate "
"representations if available, or O to use the locale's alternate numeric "
"symbols if available."
msgstr ""
"После любых флагов указывается необязательная ширина поля в виде десятичного "
"числа; затем может следовать необязательный модификатор, который принимает "
"значение «E» для использования альтернативного представления, если оно "
"доступно для заданного региона, или значение «O» для использования "
"альтернативных числовых символов, если они доступны для заданного региона."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "ПРИМЕРЫ"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Convert seconds since the Epoch (1970-01-01 UTC) to a date"
msgstr ""
"Преобразовать количество секунд, прошедших с момента Epoch (01.01.1970 00:00 "
"UTC), в дату"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "CW<$ date --date='@2147483647'>"
msgstr "CW<$ date --date='@2147483647'>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Show the time on the west coast of the US (use B<tzselect>(1) to find TZ)"
msgstr ""
"Отобразить время на Западном побережье США (используйте B<tzselect>(1), "
"чтобы найти TZ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "CW<$ TZ='America/Los_Angeles' date>"
msgstr "CW<$ TZ='America/Los_Angeles' date>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Show the local time for 9AM next Friday on the west coast of the US"
msgstr ""
"Отобразить местное время для 9 утра следующей пятницы на Западном побережье "
"США"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "CW<$ date --date='TZ=\"America/Los_Angeles\" 09:00 next Fri'>"
msgstr "CW<$ date --date='TZ=\"America/Los_Angeles\" 09:00 next Fri'>"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DATE STRING"
msgstr "СТРОКА ДАТЫ"

#.  NOTE: keep this paragraph in sync with the one in touch.x
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The --date=STRING is a mostly free format human readable date string such as "
"\"Sun, 29 Feb 2004 16:21:42 -0800\" or \"2004-02-29 16:21:42\" or even "
"\"next Thursday\".  A date string may contain items indicating calendar "
"date, time of day, time zone, day of week, relative time, relative date, and "
"numbers.  An empty string indicates the beginning of the day.  The date "
"string format is more complex than is easily documented here but is fully "
"described in the info documentation."
msgstr ""
"Параметр --date=СТРОКА представляет собой дату в практически свободной, "
"удобочитаемой для человека форме, например «Sun, 29 Feb 2004 16:21:42 "
"-0800», «2004-02-29 16:21:42» или даже «next Thursday». Строка даты может "
"содержать компоненты, задающие календарную дату, время суток, часовой пояс, "
"день недели, относительное время, относительную дату и числа. Пустая строка "
"подразумевает начало дня. Формат строки даты сложнее, чем представляется "
"возможным описать здесь, однако он полностью описан в документации info."

